The Relay Post
[trigger none]
[vignette dungeons/relay_post]

FIXME(mundane): One stone room with a back storeroom. Devra is at her desk, very quiet now. Ossal is at the brazier with his tea. The wire ticks once in its cradle and goes quiet. The storm batters the outer wall and will go on doing so until morning.

choices:

* Talk to Ossal = Sit with the bureaucrat by the brazier [requires !tag relay_post.met_ossal]
    FIXME(mundane): Ossal is old, seventies at least. He moves slowly. He is a Kesharat administrative inspector on a circuit of remote posts. He has been on the mesa for weeks. He has been out walking the back of the property checking the signal apparatus. He is tired. He is a true believer in the Kesharat system.
    FIXME(revelation): He raises the subject of the strange orders himself, having seen Devra's log on the brazier when he came in. He explains the Lattice to you. The Kesharat Administration is the instrument of the Lattice. The Lattice perceives connections humans cannot. Its directives appear arbitrary because human understanding is limited to three dimensions of space and one of time. He says this calmly and without condescension. He has been in the service fifty years. He makes his case well. At her desk Devra exhales audibly when he reaches familiar phrases. She has heard the speech before.
    +add_tag relay_post.met_ossal
    +open "The Relay Post"

* Look again at the message file [requires tag relay_post.met_ossal && !tag relay_post.predicted_arrival]
    FIXME(dread): You go back to the file with Ossal's framing in your head. Devra watches you read but does not interrupt. Halfway down the stack you find a message you did not look at carefully the first time. A routine maintenance notice. Confirm operational status of relay node at the following coordinates. Expect transient personnel. The coordinates are this building. The timestamp is from before you arrived.
    FIXME(dread): The notice has no origin header. It did not come from the capital. It arrived through the wire from the system itself. You are the transient personnel.
    +add_tag relay_post.predicted_arrival
    +open "The Relay Post"

* Wait for midnight = Settle into a corner and let the night come
    FIXME(mundane): Hours pass. The storm does not let up. Devra offers Ossal the cot in the back storeroom, which is what the storeroom is for: a place for transient Kesharat personnel to sleep on inspection rounds. Ossal accepts. He shuts the door behind him.
    FIXME(mundane): Devra explains she keeps the night shift. The regional office runs three hours ahead and most of the strange messages have come in late. She will be at the desk. She gives you a wool blanket and the chair against the wall. The storm howls. The wire is silent. You doze.
    FIXME(mundane): You wake to footsteps. The wind has dropped.
    +open "Midnight"
